<h3>Blog up and Running</h3>
<p>I've finally said goodbye to Tumblr and started using a new blog service that's hosted by my own web site provider and co-located with my own website. &nbsp;It took a full week to get it up and running so perhaps it's not a great idea.</p>
<h3>Website Updates</h3>
<p>The website has also been fairly extensively updated, although I really need to work on the CSS a bit more. &nbsp;I've changed the way the images are displayed (yet again) and I've implemented a feed from my Facebook page to the website so that I can keep the content more current. &nbsp;Over the next few months I'll work to improve the functionality.&nbsp;</p>